{"id":"f9af10c36caa5628","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-s4-complete-grz.md","title":"fact-s4-complete-grz — S4 is Complete for Reflexive Transitive Frames","display":"fact-s4-complete-grz — S4 is Complete for Reflexive Transitive Frames","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-s4-complete-grz","aliases":["89-fact-s4-complete-grz"],"display":"fact-s4-complete-grz — S4 is Complete for Reflexive Transitive Frames","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]","[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]","[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-s4-complete-grz"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-s4-complete-grz</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-s4-complete-grz — S4 is Complete for Reflexive Transitive Frames"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2645a0212ae48293\" href=\"?note=2645a0212ae48293\" title=\"89-df-reflexive-frame\">89-df-reflexive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refl}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Refl}(F)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\\)</span> are the reflexivity and transitivity predicates.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\">\\(\\forall F\\)</span> 遍历满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> 的集合对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span>；框架有效性与框架性质只在此域上调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}s4\\text{-}complete\\text{-}grz}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{S4}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Refl}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\n\\Longrightarrow F\\models A\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}s4\\text{-}complete\\text{-}grz}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{S4}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Refl}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\n\\Longrightarrow F\\models A\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\)</span> : S4逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Refl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Refl}\\)</span> : 自反框架谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2645a0212ae48293\" href=\"?note=2645a0212ae48293\" title=\"89-df-reflexive-frame\">89-df-reflexive-frame</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span> : 传递框架谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a>)</li>\n<li>S4相对自反传递框架完备</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflexive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"2645a0212ae48293","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflexive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{S4}$ : S4逻辑 (see [[89-df-modal-logic-s4]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflexive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"2645a0212ae48293","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Refl}$ : 自反框架谓词 (see [[89-df-reflexive-frame]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trans}$ : 传递框架谓词 (see [[89-df-transitive-frame]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refl}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}s4\\text{-}complete\\text{-}grz}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{S4}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Refl}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\n\\Longrightarrow F\\models A\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Refl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false}],"bytes":1250,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-589","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-fact-s4-complete-grz]]"}],"outgoing":["64bdfb29fd90b6b0","2645a0212ae48293","5c02ba5095698c09","dbba58e7bd3b0667"]}